---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const months = [
  "Januar", "Februar", "März", "April", "Mai", "Juni",
  "Juli", "August", "September", "Oktober", "November", "Dezember",
];
---

<Layout
  title="Programm 2027 – Jahresübersicht | Begleitet Reisen"
  description="Die Jahresübersicht 2027 von Begleitet Reisen: Reisen, Ausflüge und Veranstaltungen mit Stephan Mertin."
  page="legal"
  image="/reiseprogramm-2027.jpeg"
  imageAlt="Programm 2027 von Begleitet Reisen"
>
  <main class="annual-program">
    <header class="program-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Begleitet Reisen · Stephan Mertin</p>
      <h1>Programm <em>2027</em></h1>
      <p>Hier finden Sie die geplanten Reisen, Ausflüge und Veranstaltungen im Jahresüberblick. Die Übersicht wird laufend ergänzt.</p>
      <div class="individual-travel-note">
        <h2>Individuelle Reisewünsche sind herzlich willkommen!</h2>
        <p>Neben den hier aufgeführten Reisen und Veranstaltungen erreichen mich viele persönliche Anfragen für individuelle Urlaubsreisen und Ausflüge. Diese maßgeschneiderten Angebote sind nicht in der Jahresübersicht aufgeführt.</p>
        <p>Sie haben eigene Reisewünsche oder möchten einen ganz persönlichen Urlaub planen? Dann nehmen Sie gerne über den <a href="../reisekonfigurator/">Reisekonfigurator</a> Kontakt mit mir auf. Gemeinsam finden wir heraus, wie sich Ihre Reisewünsche verwirklichen lassen.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="year-table-section" aria-labelledby="year-table-title">
      <h2 id="year-table-title">Der Jahresplan</h2>
      <div class="table-scroll">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Monat</th>
              <th scope="col">Veranstaltung / Reise</th>
              <th scope="col">Datum</th>
              <th scope="col">Ort</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {months.map((month, index) => (
              <tr class={`month-row month-row-${index + 1}`}>
                <th scope="row" class={`month-cell month-cell-${index + 1}`}>{month}</th>
                {month === "Mai" ? (
                  <>
                    <td>
                      <strong class="offer-name">Städtereise Leipzig</strong>
                      <span class="places-available sold-out">Ausgebucht – keine Plätze frei</span>
                    </td>
                    <td class="offer-date">–</td>
                    <td>–</td>
                  </>
                ) : month === "Juli" ? (
                  <>
                    <td>
                      <strong class="offer-name">AIDA-Kreuzfahrt</strong>
                      <span class="places-available sold-out">Ausgebucht – keine Plätze frei</span>
                    </td>
                    <td class="offer-date">–</td>
                    <td>–</td>
                  </>
                ) : month === "Oktober" ? (
                  <>
                    <td>
                      <strong class="offer-name">Cavalluna</strong>
                      <span class="places-available">Noch 5 Plätze frei</span>
                    </td>
                    <td class="offer-date">23.10.2027</td>
                    <td>–</td>
                  </>
                ) : month === "November" ? (
                  <td colspan="3" class="multi-events-cell">
                    <div class="multi-event-list">
                      <article class="multi-event-card">
                        <div class="multi-event-top">
                          <strong class="offer-name">KARAT – 45 Jahre „Der blaue Planet“</strong>
                          <span class="event-date">20.11.2027</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="places-available">Noch 7 Plätze frei</span>
                      </article>
                      <article class="multi-event-card">
                        <div class="multi-event-top">
                          <strong class="offer-name">Eishockey: Füchse Weißwasser</strong>
                          <span class="event-date">N. N.</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="places-available">Noch 7 Plätze frei</span>
                      </article>
                    </div>
                  </td>
                ) : month === "Dezember" ? (
                  <>
                    <td>
                      <strong class="offer-name">Sascha Grammel</strong>
                      <span class="places-available">Noch 4 Plätze frei</span>
                    </td>
                    <td class="offer-date">10.12.2027</td>
                    <td>–</td>
                  </>
                ) : (
                  <>
                    <td class="to-be-announced">Weitere Angebote folgen</td>
                    <td>–</td>
                    <td>–</td>
                  </>
                )}
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="table-note">Die konkreten Termine und Veranstaltungsorte werden ergänzt, sobald sie feststehen.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="program-contact">
      <h2>Ist etwas für Sie dabei?</h2>
      <p>Wenn Sie Interesse an einer Reise oder Veranstaltung haben, nehmen Sie gerne über den Reisekonfigurator Kontakt mit mir auf. Gemeinsam besprechen wir Ihre Wünsche.</p>
      <a class="program-cta" href="../reisekonfigurator/">Zum Reisekonfigurator <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </section>

    <div class="back-home-wrap">
      <a class="back-home" href="/">← Zurück zur Startseite</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <style>
    .annual-program { max-width: 68rem; padding: 2rem 0 7rem; }
    .program-heading { max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto 4rem; text-align: center; }
    .program-heading .eyebrow { color: #339ca8; }
    .program-heading h1 { margin: .75rem 0 1.25rem; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6.5rem); font-weight: 400; line-height: .95; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
    .program-heading h1 em { color: #f26c03; font-weight: 400; }
    .program-heading > p:last-child { max-width: 42rem; margin-inline: auto; font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .individual-travel-note { max-width: 49rem; margin: 2rem auto 0; padding: 1.5rem 1.8rem; border: 1px solid rgb(12 59 109 / 14%); border-radius: 1rem; color: #0c3b6d; background: #eaf3f9; text-align: left; }
    .individual-travel-note h2 { margin: 0 0 .75rem; color: #087e8b; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; }
    .individual-travel-note p { margin: .65rem 0 0; font-size: .98rem; line-height: 1.65; }
    .individual-travel-note a { color: #087e8b; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .15em; }
    .year-table-section h2, .highlights h2, .program-contact h2 { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    .table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid rgb(12 59 109 / 18%); border-radius: 1rem; box-shadow: 0 .8rem 2rem rgb(8 43 85 / 7%); }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #fff; text-align: left; }
    th, td { padding: 1rem 1.1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(12 59 109 / 13%); vertical-align: top; }
    thead th { color: #fff; background: #0c3b6d; font-size: .78rem; letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    tbody th { width: 17%; font-weight: 800; }
    tbody tr:last-child th, tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
    .month-row td { transition: background-color .2s ease; }
    .month-cell { border-right: 1px solid rgb(12 59 109 / 9%); }
    .month-row-1 td, .month-cell-1 { background: #eaf3f9; }
    .month-row-2 td, .month-cell-2 { background: #e7f4f1; }
    .month-row-3 td, .month-cell-3 { background: #f0eef9; }
    .month-row-4 td, .month-cell-4 { background: #fff2e8; }
    .month-row-5 td, .month-cell-5 { background: #f8edf2; }
    .month-row-6 td, .month-cell-6 { background: #e8f2f7; }
    .month-row-7 td, .month-cell-7 { background: #edf3e7; }
    .month-row-8 td, .month-cell-8 { background: #f3eef8; }
    .month-row-9 td, .month-cell-9 { background: #e5f3f4; }
    .month-row-10 td, .month-cell-10 { background: #fff1e5; }
    .month-row-11 td, .month-cell-11 { background: #f5edf0; }
    .month-row-12 td, .month-cell-12 { background: #e5eff9; }
    .offer-name, .offer-date { color: #087e8b; font-weight: 800; }
    .offer-name { letter-spacing: .01em; }
    .event-date { flex: 0 0 auto; color: #087e8b; font-weight: 800; white-space: nowrap; }
    .multi-events-cell { padding: .8rem 1rem; }
    .multi-event-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr)); gap: .75rem; }
    .multi-event-card { min-width: 0; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; border: 1px solid rgb(12 59 109 / 13%); border-radius: .75rem; background: rgb(255 255 255 / 72%); }
    .multi-event-top { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: .35rem 1rem; }
    .places-available { display: block; margin-top: .45rem; color: #0c3b6d; font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .sold-out { color: #a33b3b; }
    .to-be-announced { color: #56738d; }
    .table-note { margin: 1rem 0 0; color: #56738d; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.6; }
    .highlights { margin-top: 5rem; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); border-radius: 1.25rem; color: #082b55; background: #dceef8; }
    .highlights p { line-height: 1.6; }
    .highlights ul { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: .75rem 2rem; margin: 1.25rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; }
    .program-contact { margin-top: 4rem; padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); border-radius: 1.5rem; color: #fff; background: #0c3b6d; }
    .program-contact p { max-width: 45rem; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .program-cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem; padding: 1rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 999px; color: #0c3b6d; background: #fff; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; }
    .program-cta:hover { background: #dceef8; }
    .back-home-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
    .back-home { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 1rem 1.6rem; border: 2px solid #0c3b6d; border-radius: 999px; color: #0c3b6d; background: #eaf3f9; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; transition: background-color .2s ease, color .2s ease; }
    .back-home:hover { color: #fff; background: #0c3b6d; }
    @media (max-width: 42rem) {
      .annual-program { padding-top: 1rem; }
      .table-scroll { overflow: visible; border: 0; box-shadow: none; }
      table, tbody { display: block; }
      thead { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; }
      tbody tr { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: .35rem .75rem; margin-bottom: .85rem; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid rgb(12 59 109 / 18%); border-radius: .85rem; background: #fff; }
      tbody th { grid-column: 1 / -1; width: auto; padding: 0 0 .5rem; background: transparent; font-size: 1.1rem; }
      tbody td { padding: .25rem 0; border: 0; font-size: .9rem; }
      tbody td.offer-date { color: #087e8b; }
      tbody td:nth-child(2) { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
      tbody td.multi-events-cell { grid-column: 1 / -1; padding: .2rem 0 0; }
      .multi-event-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .65rem; }
      .multi-event-card { padding: .85rem .95rem; }
      .multi-event-top { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: .25rem; }
      .highlights ul { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
